0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"This looks good now, and great improvement IMO!","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#pullrequestreview-3318512979","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110796","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-29T08:38:47Z"},{"id":3408759463,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7LLYqn","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"The readability is still rather poor when there is lots of text behind the panel:\n\n<img width=\"656\" height=\"173\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d16b5c3-6bf6-4969-9076-1176e132e12b\" />\n\nYou could decrease its opacity or add font outline or something.\n\nAlso, if it's not too difficult, the panel should move to the other side if it's under the cursor. If someone wants to drop something in the place where the panel appeared, it may be difficult.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#pullrequestreview-3408759463","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110796","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-02T12:15:18Z"},{"id":3430314048,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7MdnBA","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"It's more readable but still pretty noisy.\r\nThe light mode one also looks a bit off, using white text when nothing else does. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"416\" height=\"127\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73e23f66-ab94-4a2f-8dd2-bea4eaf169cb\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"392\" height=\"90\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff705d37-9d62-4765-b846-47d51a07cde4\" />\r\n\r\nWe should probably just make it opaque, then the text can use its default settings. We can also use an existing StyleBox as a base.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#pullrequestreview-3430314048","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110796","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-11-06T22:03:04Z"},{"id":3556416094,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7T-ppe","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#pullrequestreview-3556416094","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110796","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-12-09T09:48:47Z"},{"id":3760726361,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7gKCFZ","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#pullrequestreview-3760726361","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110796","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-02-06T04:30:56Z"},{"id":3785269184,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7hnp_A","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"Looks good.\n\n`_load_theme_settings` is a good place for it, it gets called on theme changed notification (through a signal).\n\nDark:\n\n<img width=\"557\" height=\"240\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c96da11-c33f-4046-afc7-0a1d751e9fe5\" />\n\nLight:\n<img width=\"572\" height=\"260\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a633ecbb-e867-4f95-8486-7e42a1bc02d6\" />\n\nOver text:\n<img width=\"427\" height=\"152\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/60a604da-cb9d-4cd9-bb6f-a4e7d9e3a35a\" />\n\n> Also, I think the text/color is still too harsh and \"in your face\". What other options would you try?\n\nIf the colors are good for completion popup then they are good here I think. If it feels too \"in your face\" then it is probably because of the border. We could remove it, or reduce the alpha of it if you want.\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#pullrequestreview-3785269184","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110796","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-02-11T14:45:55Z"},{"id":3786602539,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7hsvgr","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#pullrequestreview-3786602539","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110796","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-02-11T18:40:58Z"},{"id":3787074440,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7huiuI","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_rep